<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Order Gateway — {{app_name}}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/soe.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <h1>Order Gateway</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Submit a host build request</p>
        </header>

        {{#error}}
        <div class="alert alert-error">
            {{error}}
        </div>
        {{/error}}

        <main class="main">
            <div class="card">
                <form method="POST" action="/order" class="form">
                    <fieldset>
                        <legend>Tell us what you need</legend>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="app_name">
                                <strong>Application / System Name</strong>
                                <span class="required">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <input
                                type="text"
                                id="app_name"
                                name="app_name"
                                placeholder="e.g., Benefits Portal, HR System, Analytics Platform"
                                required
                                class="input"
                            >
                            <small>The system you're deploying</small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="environment">
                                <strong>Environment</strong>
                                <span class="required">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <select id="environment" name="environment" required class="input">
                                <option value="">Select...</option>
                                {{#environments}}
                                <option value="{{.}}">{{.}}</option>
                                {{/environments}}
                            </select>
                            <small>Where this system will run</small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="sensitivity">
                                <strong>Data Sensitivity</strong>
                                <span class="required">*</span>
                            </label>
                            <select id="sensitivity" name="sensitivity" required class="input">
                                <option value="">Select...</option>
                                {{#sensitivities}}
                                <option value="{{.}}">{{.}}</option>
                                {{/sensitivities}}
                            </select>
                            <small>Highest classification of data this system will handle</small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-row">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="expected_users">
                                    <strong>Expected Concurrent Users</strong>
                                </label>
                                <input
                                    type="number"
                                    id="expected_users"
                                    name="expected_users"
                                    placeholder="50"
                                    min="1"
                                    class="input"
                                >
                                <small>Estimated peak usage</small>
                            </div>

                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="need_by">
                                    <strong>Need By Date</strong>
                                </label>
                                <input
                                    type="date"
                                    id="need_by"
                                    name="need_by"
                                    class="input"
                                >
                                <small>Target delivery date</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="context">
                                <strong>Additional Context</strong>
                            </label>
                            <textarea
                                id="context"
                                name="context"
                                placeholder="Any additional requirements or notes..."
                                rows="4"
                                class="input textarea"
                            ></textarea>
                            <small>Free-form notes about your needs</small>
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>

                    <div class="form-actions">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Order</button>
                        <a href="/tracker" class="btn btn-secondary">View Orders</a>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <aside class="sidebar">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>What happens next?</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li><strong>Intake.</strong> Your request is received and validated.</li>
                        <li><strong>Solutioning.</strong> We match your needs to a certified template.</li>
                        <li><strong>Routing.</strong> Work is routed to the right teams.</li>
                        <li><strong>Build-out.</strong> Teams work in parallel: OS, security, identity, certs, firewalls.</li>
                        <li><strong>Handover.</strong> The system is ready for use.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>Who we do NOT ask</h3>
                    <p>You don't need to specify:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Operating system version</li>
                        <li>Security baselines or hardening</li>
                        <li>Firewall policies</li>
                        <li>SSL certificate authority</li>
                        <li>Datacenter or region</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p><small>Policy decides all of that automatically.</small></p>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
